tion with  friends or parents we actually find  parents think it's really helpful for  carpool because you can see you know if  your if your friend's family has really  left the house to come pick up your  child  so so i think that's almost there yeah  just like you are  so so that's been a lot of fun and of  course not only can you see where your  friends are up to you can actually tap  in and see videos all around the world  so it's a really cool way to learn about  what's happening you know in the world  around you do you have any thoughts on  elon musk's possible purchase of twitter  well he's certainly a very passionate  super user of twitter so i'm sure he's  got a lot of great ideas did he offer to  buy snap before he went well  more daily active users he paid 44  billion so you're doing okay over there  evan hey you're not selling for anything  less than 100 billion that's basically  what you're saying tony heaven we  appreciate you thank you so much for  joining us and filled in some of these  tough questions as well

